      "en": "Popular and economical hatchback renowned for outstanding fuel economy, low maintenance, and effortless parking. Richly specified with cruise control, air conditioning, and reversing camera and parking sensors. Very low mileage with bodywork and interior in near-showroom condition. Available for daily rental in Casablanca with airport and hotel delivery options. Turnkey rental condition with up-to-date maintenance, ready to hit the road immediately.",
