      "en": "Versatile family crossover featuring a commanding driving position, generous luggage space, and dependable road manner. Richly specified with air conditioning, reversing camera and parking sensors, and cruise control. Very low mileage with bodywork and interior in near-showroom condition. Available for daily rental in Tangier with airport and hotel delivery options. Turnkey rental condition with up-to-date maintenance, ready to hit the road immediately.",
